            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-400">
                <li>Check <code class="text-indigo-300">DB_CONNECTION</code> in your <code class="text-indigo-300">.env</code> file (<code class="text-emerald-400">postgres</code>, <code class="text-emerald-400">sqlite</code>, <code class="text-emerald-400">mysql</code>).</li>
                <li>Verify <code class="text-indigo-300">DB_HOST</code>, <code class="text-indigo-300">DB_PORT</code>, <code class="text-indigo-300">DB_DATABASE</code>, <code class="text-indigo-300">DB_USERNAME</code>, and <code class="text-indigo-300">DB_PASSWORD</code>.</li>
                <li>Ensure your PostgreSQL / MySQL database daemon service is active and listening.</li>
